    subtitleLines:
    - text: The drawer was completely shut.
      duration: 2
    - text: ' I checked it three times and took a picture so I wouldn''t worry.'
      duration: 4
    - text: Now it's open. I can't leave until it's closed.
      duration: 3
  - photoCanvas: {fileID: 1230061328}
    voiceOver: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 873fcc12603bc97449d4e22cd4099037, type: 3}
    subtitleLines:
    - text: " I took this picture of Luna on the chair.\t"
      duration: 2.5
    - text: You can see the books right there in the background. They were perfectly
        in order
      duration: 3.5
    - text: Thank god. Good girl, Luna. I just need to match this exactly.
      duration: 4
